  "document": "Lawrence Huntington\nLawrence Huntington (1900–1968) was a British film director, screenwriter and producer. Huntington was born in London on 9 March 1900, he directed more than thirty films following his debut feature \"After Many Years\" (1930). He later worked in television before his death in 1968."
